{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"build123d","tool":"validate","arguments":{"object_name":"candidate"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Validity gate: FAIL — 1 face(s) failed to tessellate — the exported boundary is incomplete (un-meshable or degenerate face); 1 face(s) failed to tessellate at a finer mesh deflection — the B-rep is tolerance-sensitive and may be rejected by downstream CAD consumers; 74 mesh open edge(s) — the tessellated boundary is not closed (non-conformal face junction or unsewn faces) even though the B-rep edges look matched; 3 mesh non-manifold vertex/vertices — ≥2 surface sheets meet at a single point (e.g. bodies touching corner-to-corner); edge-manifold and watertight but not a 2-manifold surface, which a CAD scorer rejects — the build123d://skill/repair resource has the defect-class repair ladder\n{\n  \"passes_gate\": false,\n  \"n_solids\": 1,\n  \"volume\": 427389.7074,\n  \"overlap_check\": \"exact\",\n  \"overlapping_pairs\": 0,\n  \"pairwise_overlap_volume\": 0.0,\n  \"watertight_manifold\": true,\n  \"open_edges\": 0,\n  \"nonmanifold_edges\": 0,\n  \"mesh_nonmanifold_edges\": 0,\n  \"mesh_nonmanifold_vertices\": 3,\n  \"mesh_open_edges\": 74,\n  \"mesh_vertex_deflection_defects\": 0,\n  \"untriangulated_faces\": 1,\n  \"refined_untriangulated_faces\": 1,\n  \"refined_untriangulated_faces_verified\": true,\n  \"mesh_check\": \"exact-subprocess\",\n  \"brep_valid\": true,\n  \"warnings\": [],\n  \"reasons\": [\n    \"1 face(s) failed to tessellate \\u2014 the exported boundary is incomplete (un-meshable or degenerate face)\",\n    \"1 face(s) failed to tessellate at a finer mesh deflection \\u2014 the B-rep is tolerance-sensitive and may be rejected by downstream CAD consumers\",\n    \"74 mesh open edge(s) \\u2014 the tessellated boundary is not closed (non-conformal face junction or unsewn faces) even though the B-rep edges look matched\",\n    \"3 mesh non-manifold vertex/vertices \\u2014 \\u22652 surface sheets meet at a single point (e.g. bodies touching corner-to-corner); edge-manifold and watertight but not a 2-manifold surface, which a CAD scorer rejects\"\n  ]\n}"}],"structured_content":{"result":"Validity gate: FAIL — 1 face(s) failed to tessellate — the exported boundary is incomplete (un-meshable or degenerate face); 1 face(s) failed to tessellate at a finer mesh deflection — the B-rep is tolerance-sensitive and may be rejected by downstream CAD consumers; 74 mesh open edge(s) — the tessellated boundary is not closed (non-conformal face junction or unsewn faces) even though the B-rep edges look matched; 3 mesh non-manifold vertex/vertices — ≥2 surface sheets meet at a single point (e.g. bodies touching corner-to-corner); edge-manifold and watertight but not a 2-manifold surface, which a CAD scorer rejects — the build123d://skill/repair resource has the defect-class repair ladder\n{\n  \"passes_gate\": false,\n  \"n_solids\": 1,\n  \"volume\": 427389.7074,\n  \"overlap_check\": \"exact\",\n  \"overlapping_pairs\": 0,\n  \"pairwise_overlap_volume\": 0.0,\n  \"watertight_manifold\": true,\n  \"open_edges\": 0,\n  \"nonmanifold_edges\": 0,\n  \"mesh_nonmanifold_edges\": 0,\n  \"mesh_nonmanifold_vertices\": 3,\n  \"mesh_open_edges\": 74,\n  \"mesh_vertex_deflection_defects\": 0,\n  \"untriangulated_faces\": 1,\n  \"refined_untriangulated_faces\": 1,\n  \"refined_untriangulated_faces_verified\": true,\n  \"mesh_check\": \"exact-subprocess\",\n  \"brep_valid\": true,\n  \"warnings\": [],\n  \"reasons\": [\n    \"1 face(s) failed to tessellate \\u2014 the exported boundary is incomplete (un-meshable or degenerate face)\",\n    \"1 face(s) failed to tessellate at a finer mesh deflection \\u2014 the B-rep is tolerance-sensitive and may be rejected by downstream CAD consumers\",\n    \"74 mesh open edge(s) \\u2014 the tessellated boundary is not closed (non-conformal face junction or unsewn faces) even though the B-rep edges look matched